Date: Thu, 21 Mar 2024 17:12:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(cdk/a11y): support signals in ListKeyManager (#28757)

Updates the `ListKeyManager` to support passing in a signal. Also expands the type to allow readonly arrays.

Fixes #28710.
---
 .../a11y/key-manager/list-key-manager.spec.ts | 31 +++++++++-
 src/cdk/a11y/key-manager/list-key-manager.ts  | 56 +++++++++++++------
 tools/public_api_guard/cdk/a11y.md            |  5 +-
 3 files changed, 71 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

